<ul class="zone-card__list">
<li>Ballast-bypass for max efficiency</li>
<li>4000K–5000K for product appeal</li>
<li>Instant-on, mercury-free</li>
<li>Universal voltage 120–277V</li>
<li>Direct retrofit for existing cases</li>
</ul>
</article>
