<div class="zone-card__num">Zone 07</div>
<h3 class="zone-card__title">Signage, Accent &amp; Upscale Deli/Bakery</h3>
<div class="zone-card__product">LED Tubes (sign cabinets) + NOSTALGIC Decorative Lamps</div>
