<p class="callout-dark__body">ALG is one of the few manufacturers offering a complete store lighting package — from −40°F freezer fixtures to fuel canopy luminaires — under one brand. Single-source procurement reduces coordination costs, simplifies warranty management, and ensures consistent light quality throughout the customer journey. One PO. One warranty contact. One consistent look.</p>
